This project implements the JOLT / JOLT+ method described in
"A Good Self-Teacher Meets the Student Where They Are: Joint On-Policy
Learning and Teaching" (arXiv:2610.10447): https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.10447

Model weights and Python dependencies (see requirements.txt) are not included
or redistributed; they are licensed separately by their respective authors.

The datasets in datasets/ are partly derived from the documentation of the Rust
standard library and of third-party crates (MIT OR Apache-2.0, MIT). Sources,
versions, copyright notices and license texts are listed in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
